       en="*ενώ* (whereas, while), *παρόλο που / αν και* + indicative (although), *ωστόσο / παρ’ όλα αυτά* (nevertheless, opening a sentence), *όμως* (however, usually after the first word). These signal the two-sided argument expected in a B2–C1 essay.",
